After we become friends like before, we'll be able to share a promised kiss...

263
00:19:14,225 --> 00:19:17,225
that's all we'll have to do to make a human forever!

264
00:19:17,225 --> 00:19:18,225
...

265
00:19:18,225 --> 00:19:22,545
As long as you don't forget, love, you'll never, ever be alone.

266
00:19:22,765 --> 00:19:26,685
And if you don't give up, then even if you lose something, you won't be invisible.

267
00:19:29,745 --> 00:19:30,705
Shut up!

268
00:19:31,065 --> 00:19:33,025
It's your fault everyone died!

269
00:19:33,425 --> 00:19:34,325
Even Sumika!

270
00:19:34,945 --> 00:19:36,185
I won't forgive you!

271
00:19:36,505 --> 00:19:38,705
I'll never forgive any of you bears!

272
00:19:41,185 --> 00:19:42,105
Stop this.

273
00:19:42,505 --> 00:19:43,965
Just go to the other side, alright?

274
00:19:44,545 --> 00:19:46,825
I already sent Lulu back through the door of friendship.

275
00:19:46,825 --> 00:19:50,545
Go to her, and never return here again!

276
00:19:57,845 --> 00:19:59,025
Don't move!

277
00:20:00,145 --> 00:20:02,605
Ginko, stay away!

278
00:20:03,245 --> 00:20:04,005
Please stop!

279
00:20:04,485 --> 00:20:05,645
I won't stop.

280
00:20:06,185 --> 00:20:08,245
I can't, I'll never back down on love!

281
00:20:11,865 --> 00:20:15,145
Kureha, I'll never back down on my love either.

282
00:20:16,825 --> 00:20:17,825
Help!

283
00:20:17,825 --> 00:20:19,745
I don't want to lose anyone else!

284
00:20:19,745 --> 00:20:22,745
No.

285
00:20:47,725 --> 00:20:49,165
Hello!

286
00:20:49,745 --> 00:20:55,985
Lulu's sorry, Curry Pie, but she had to come back.

287
00:20:59,265 --> 00:21:02,725
Oh, Curry Pie, you're such a mad liar.

288
00:21:04,045 --> 00:21:05,925
No, Lulu!

289
00:21:06,825 --> 00:21:14,445
She let Lulu escape, said Lulu wasn't her friend, but her lie was, it was super duper obvious to Lulu.

290
00:21:15,225 --> 00:21:19,145
Ginko, Lulu knows it will work out. She knows it.

291
00:21:20,485 --> 00:21:24,085
Curry Pie is going to forgive you? No, that's not true.

292
00:21:25,345 --> 00:21:27,405
She already has forgiven you.

293
00:21:28,785 --> 00:21:32,245
You can finally be your friend, Ginko, isn't that wonderful?

294
00:21:33,045 --> 00:21:35,705
Make your love come true, okay?

295
00:21:36,525 --> 00:21:41,065
You can get a promised kiss. Lulu believes it. She believes in you.

296
00:21:41,065 --> 00:21:45,385
Here, Lulu collected this. It's your future.

297
00:21:49,745 --> 00:21:51,765
Lulu is so clever, isn't she?

298
00:21:52,425 --> 00:21:53,065
Growl.

299
00:22:04,345 --> 00:22:04,845
Dan!

300
00:22:12,265 --> 00:22:13,185
Lulu, no!

301
00:22:13,185 --> 00:22:14,205
Lulu!

302
00:22:14,245 --> 00:22:14,805
Lulu!

303
00:22:14,865 --> 00:22:15,305
Lulu!

304
00:22:15,305 --> 00:22:15,865
Lulu!

305
00:22:15,865 --> 00:22:17,025
Lulu!

306
00:22:17,025 --> 00:22:47,005
Thank you.

307
00:23:47,051 --> 00:23:54,051
Defendant Human Koreha Tsubaki, are you ready to admit your crime?

